Clean-room boundary
-------------------
The inherited ApexCharts implementation is version 4.7.0 (MIT); the repository
also contains new West Coast Charts work. The documented implementation rule
prohibits copying or using ApexCharts 5.0.0+ source, bundles, tarballs or type
files. The separate specification research described in docs/spec/00-index.md
used public descriptions of later behaviour and API facts (option names,
types and defaults). It records that descriptions were independently written
and later source/bundles/type files were not used. Implementers work from that
specification, not later upstream implementation material. These records do
not mean that later public documentation was never consulted. See README.md,
"Rules for contributors".

